---
import '../../styles/trades-launch.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Twistor Trades — Header and hero review</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A proposed maintenance workflow for property teams and the trades they trust. Twistor Trades prelaunch concept." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#091526" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="shell masthead">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Twistor home"><span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">t</span> twistor<span class="brand-product">/ trades</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="nav-cta" href="#concept">The concept <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="shell hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal" aria-hidden="true"></span> DENVER PILOT IN PREPARATION</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">Every request.<br/><span>A clear next step.</span></h1>
          <p class="lede">For the people managing properties.<br/>And the trades keeping them running.</p>
          <p class="hero-detail">We're building a shared maintenance workflow—from a resident's first report to an approved provider and a documented closeout.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#concept">See the workflow concept <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
          <p class="release-note">PRELAUNCH CONCEPT · SERVICE IS NOT OPEN</p>
        </div>
        <div class="visual" id="concept" role="region" aria-label="Illustrative maintenance workflow" tabindex="-1">
          <div class="orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="dispatch-panel">
            <div class="panel-top"><span class="mini-brand">TWISTOR / TRADE VIEW</span><span class="sample-pill">CONCEPT ONLY</span></div>
            <div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="small-label">SAMPLE REQUEST</p><h2>Leaking kitchen faucet</h2></div><span class="trade-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
            <p class="location">Fictional property · Unit 204 · Routine plumbing</p>
            <ol class="journey"><li class="done"><span>01</span><div><strong>Request received</strong><small>Issue and availability recorded.</small></div><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></li><li class="done"><span>02</span><div><strong>Manager approved</strong><small>Scope and spending agreed.</small></div><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></li><li class="active"><span>03</span><div><strong>Provider accepted</strong><small>One company assigned.</small></div><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></li><li><span>04</span><div><strong>Completion review</strong><small>Evidence before closeout.</small></div><b aria-hidden="true">○</b></li></ol>
            <div class="panel-bottom">ILLUSTRATIVE DATA · NO LIVE DISPATCH</div>
          </div>
          <div class="floating-label"><span aria-hidden="true">⌁</span> From reported to resolved.</div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <aside class="review-note shell" aria-label="Design review status">ITERATION 01 — HEADER + HERO. Copy and design are proposed for review. No signup, countdown or launch date is active.</aside>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
